      "outcome": "Read/continuation failures do not settle earlier work; local validation is not_submitted; dispatched unconfirmed commands remain unknown",
      "durable_evidence": "Read attempt evidence is distinct from saved domain outcomes; the selected namespace is caller context, not proof of existence or permission",
      "context": "Selected namespace and draft generation; original cause, specific result/upload/requester failure; raw EndOfStream lacks origin attribution and says so",
      "disclosure": "No extra metadata lookup, payload, credential or unrelated row disclosure; only existing original caller/owner evidence",
      "recovery": "Exact namespace inspection, current scope or read retry according to cause; unknown submission reconciles only exact signed transport identity",
      "propagation": "Unlisted dynamic/I/O errors remain internal or unknown after dispatch. Error names shared with source execution use the caller classifier first, including ambiguous EndOfStream. This is not a transitive whole-program proof.",
